    "title": "RoboTone",
    "description": "Hit the tones, beat the robo!\r\nRoboTone is an application to strengthen absolute listening skill for your kids, especially grade school students.\r\nThey say, it's difficult to get the absolute listening skill after grown up, so try this app before you getting old.\r\n\r\nFirst of all, play the piano as you like to listen and be familiar with the tones from this app.\r\n\r\nNext, tap the battle button and do the battle.\r\nSelect the tone(s) you listen, press the answer to go!\r\nYou are correct, the robo's power deceases.\r\nIt's time to beat the robo!\r\n\r\nTo tap the setting button, you can change the tones number and instrument.",
